      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just realized that, once the host is deprivileged, the host can cause vmexit to pKVM if it modifies the xcr0/xss. If this happens before the host send pkvm_init hypercall, the kvm_host is not initialized so kvm_host.xcr0/xss are 0, then this check will be true even the val is actually the same with the HW XSS, causing host receiving a #GP. But I think in practical, such case will not happen. So just add a note here.",
